# Copy to .env for local use. Never commit .env.
SLEEPER_LEAGUE_ID=1386106937921253376
# Reports use your Claude subscription through the `claude` command, so no key is needed locally.
# In GitHub Actions only (as secrets, not here): CLAUDE_CODE_OAUTH_TOKEN (from `claude setup-token`) and CF_DEPLOY_HOOK_URL.
# Trade finder values come from FANTASYCALC in the shell, not this file. Unset means the page says it's off.
# Try it locally with made up values: FANTASYCALC=sample npm run dev
# Only the Cloudflare Pages production environment sets FANTASYCALC=live. Never use live locally or in tests.
